## The release job, simulated end to end (T-0036)

A copy of the workspace was built in /tmp/pubcheck with a **throwaway pinned key**
(minisign -G; key id D88DB7DB9A6D7AE0) swapped into supply-chain/arreo.pub. The
operator's real key was never involved and its secret never existed on this machine.
This exercises the CLI's *success* path with the real code — the crate-level tests
must use a throwaway key via verify_with, while the product binary only ever trusts
the key compiled into it.

