### the tamper check — one flipped byte of a copy, valid signature carried over
update: /tmp/relsim2/tampered: signature does not authenticate this file (The signature verification failed)
refused, exit=1 — the job fails, as it must

### a MINISIGN_SECRET_KEY belonging to another key (the misconfiguration gate)
update: SHA256SUMS: signed by key 8D6501077D3EE876, this build trusts D88DB7DB9A6D7AE0
refused, exit=1 — the job refuses to publish under an unpinned key

### a missing .minisig (the fail-hard check)
update: arreo-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.exe: no signature at arreo-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.exe.minisig — refusing an unverified artifact
refused, exit=1 — the 'fail if any artifact lacks its .minisig' step fails
